# Cloudflare Workers static-asset redirects (processed before asset lookup).
# Fixes Google Search Console "Page with redirect" / "Not found (404)" reports.

# 1) Bare room URLs -> canonical trailing-slash URLs, PERMANENT (301).
#    Without these, Workers' auto-trailing-slash handling answers with a
#    temporary 307, which Google treats as a weaker signal.
/ponderosa      /ponderosa/      301
/meadow         /meadow/         301
/littlemeadow   /littlemeadow/   301
/hilltop        /hilltop/        301
/lake           /lake/           301
/loft           /loft/           301
/winbeds        /winbeds/        301
/quick-checklist /quick-checklist/ 301

# 2) Member pages live only on myhlh.com (see overview: nothing from the
#    hlhid family belongs in HLHWEB). Old links Google still has get sent there.
/hlhid* https://myhlh.com/hlhid:splat 301
/toc    https://myhlh.com/toc 301
/toc/   https://myhlh.com/toc 301
